      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102300304/1023003040010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003040020,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "なんか、夜はカメラ回らないって\r\n聞いてたんですけど──……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300304/1023003040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "男子高生アイドル",
    "text": "ごめんね、ダンスの練習中に\r\n……収録の合間にも練習なんて偉いね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003040030,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～……\r\n決められた分はちゃんとやるタイプなので～",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300304/1023003040030"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1300
  },
  {
    "speaker": "男子高生アイドル",
    "text": "そっか……やりながらでもいいんだけど\r\nちょっと、話聞いてもらえないかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003040040,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "へ～？\r\n話、ですか～……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300304/1023003040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "男子高生アイドル",
    "text": "うん、最終日……\r\n雛菜ちゃんはなんて書くかもう決めてる？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003040050,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あ～……『進路調査書』ですよね～？\r\nまだ全然考えてないですけど～……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300304/1023003040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "男子高生アイドル",
    "text": "僕はね、ここに来る前から夢を取るって決めてて……\r\nだから、最終日には『アイドル』って書くつもりだったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "男子高生アイドル",
    "text": "最初にも言った通り、僕はこの番組を通して\r\n僕たちのユニットを知ってもらうために来た",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "男子高生アイドル",
    "text": "……だけど、さっき最終日に僕の名前を書きたいって\r\n言ってきた子がいたんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003040060,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "へ～？\r\nあ、あ～………………",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300304/1023003040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "男子高生アイドル",
    "text": "こんなこと、予想してなかったから……\r\nファンのみんなを、驚かせちゃうだろうし……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "男子高生アイドル",
    "text": "雛菜ちゃんなら、同じアイドルとして\r\nこういう時、どうするかなって思って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003040070,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "…………\r\nなんか、よくわかんないですけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300304/1023003040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003040080,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "多分、雛菜たちって、\r\nアイドルだけど『同じ』じゃ、ないと思います",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300304/1023003040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "男子高生アイドル",
    "text": "え…………？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003040090,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜は誰かのためじゃなくて\r\n自分が楽しくしあわせでいるために、アイドルしてるので",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300304/1023003040090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003040100,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "そういう雛菜を見て、誰かが楽しくなったり\r\nしあわせになったりしてくれるから",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300304/1023003040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003040110,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……だから、いつも雛菜は\r\n雛菜がしあわせな方を、選ぶようにしてます",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300304/1023003040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003040120,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "…………いつも",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
