  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──はい、じゃあ\r\n雛菜は……スポーツドリンクな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日もレッスン頑張ってきてくれ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003040130,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～\r\n雛菜はいつも頑張ってるよ～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
