  {
    "speaker": "トレーナー",
    "text": "──あ、雛菜ちゃん！\r\n『恋ませ』最新話見たよ、ダンスの練習してるところ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003040150,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～\r\nトレーナーさん、見ました～？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102300304/1023003040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "トレーナー",
    "text": "雛菜ちゃんがちゃんと練習してくれてたところが映ってて\r\n嬉しくなっちゃったよ……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003040160,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "へ～？\r\n雛菜、いつもやってますよ～？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300304/1023003040160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003040170,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……ね、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300304/1023003040170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003040180,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜、映ってないとこでも決まった分は\r\nちゃんとやってたよね～？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300304/1023003040180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、ちゃんとやってたよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今回みたいに練習してるシーンはもう\r\n映らないかもしれないけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも毎日、ちゃんと決まった時間と\r\n決まった内容で、練習してたもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003040190,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "うん～！\r\nしてたしてた～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300304/1023003040190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……トレーナーさんも、練習用の動画とか\r\n色々準備して下さって、ありがとうございました",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "トレーナー",
    "text": "いえ……最初のレッスンから、\r\nかなり踊れてるなとは思ってたんですけど……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "トレーナー",
    "text": "撮影中もちゃんと練習してたとは……\r\n偉いぞ雛菜ちゃん！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003040200,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "やは～\r\n褒められちゃった、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300304/1023003040200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、本当にその通りだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……忙しいこの期間、\r\n雛菜はよく頑張ってくれてたよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういう雛菜に、置いていかれないように\r\n俺も頑張らないとだな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "トレーナー",
    "text": "あはは、そうですね\r\n雛菜ちゃんの頑張りに、私も応えないと！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "トレーナー",
    "text": "……ってことで、\r\n今日のレッスンは厳しめにいこうか！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003040210,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "へ～！？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102300304/1023003040210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003040220,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "なんか、それ\r\n雛菜得したのか損したのかわかんないけど～",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
